<form version="1.1" theme="light">
  <label>Auto-cancel 재현용 (패널 30개, 독립 검색)</label>
  <description>패널마다 별도 검색 job이 생성됩니다 (총 30개). 캔슬 시 상단 표에서 sid를 확인하세요.</description>
  <fieldset submitButton="false" autoRun="true">
    <input type="time" token="tr" searchWhenChanged="true">
      <label>시간 범위</label>
      <default><earliest>-24h@h</earliest><latest>now</latest></default>
    </input>
  </fieldset>
  <row>
    <panel>
      <title>패널별 SID / 상태 (캔슬된 sid를 _internal에서 추적할 때 사용)</title>
      <html>
        <table class="table table-condensed"><thead><tr><th>패널</th><th>SID</th><th>상태</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>p01</td><td>$sid_p01$</td><td>$sid_p01_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p02</td><td>$sid_p02$</td><td>$sid_p02_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p03</td><td>$sid_p03$</td><td>$sid_p03_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p04</td><td>$sid_p04$</td><td>$sid_p04_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p05</td><td>$sid_p05$</td><td>$sid_p05_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p06</td><td>$sid_p06$</td><td>$sid_p06_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p07</td><td>$sid_p07$</td><td>$sid_p07_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p08</td><td>$sid_p08$</td><td>$sid_p08_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p09</td><td>$sid_p09$</td><td>$sid_p09_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p10</td><td>$sid_p10$</td><td>$sid_p10_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p11</td><td>$sid_p11$</td><td>$sid_p11_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p12</td><td>$sid_p12$</td><td>$sid_p12_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p13</td><td>$sid_p13$</td><td>$sid_p13_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p14</td><td>$sid_p14$</td><td>$sid_p14_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p15</td><td>$sid_p15$</td><td>$sid_p15_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p16</td><td>$sid_p16$</td><td>$sid_p16_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p17</td><td>$sid_p17$</td><td>$sid_p17_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p18</td><td>$sid_p18$</td><td>$sid_p18_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p19</td><td>$sid_p19$</td><td>$sid_p19_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p20</td><td>$sid_p20$</td><td>$sid_p20_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p21</td><td>$sid_p21$</td><td>$sid_p21_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p22</td><td>$sid_p22$</td><td>$sid_p22_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p23</td><td>$sid_p23$</td><td>$sid_p23_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p24</td><td>$sid_p24$</td><td>$sid_p24_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p25</td><td>$sid_p25$</td><td>$sid_p25_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p26</td><td>$sid_p26$</td><td>$sid_p26_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p27</td><td>$sid_p27$</td><td>$sid_p27_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p28</td><td>$sid_p28$</td><td>$sid_p28_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p29</td><td>$sid_p29$</td><td>$sid_p29_state$</td></tr><tr><td>p30</td><td>$sid_p30$</td><td>$sid_p30_state$</td></tr></tbody></table>
      </html>
    </panel>
  </row>
  <row>
      <panel id="p01">
        <title>01. splunkd 컴포넌트별 로그 건수</title>
        <table>
          <search>
            <query>index=_internal sourcetype=splunkd | stats count by component | eventstats sum(count) as total | eval pct=round(count*100/total,2) | sort - count | head 20</query>
            <earliest>$tr.earliest$</earliest>
            <latest>$tr.latest$</latest>
            <progress><set token="sid_p01">$job.sid$</set></progress>
            <done><set token="sid_p01_state">$job.dispatchState$ ($job.runDuration$s)</set></done>
            <error><set token="sid_p01_state">ERROR: $message$</set></error>
            <cancelled><set token="sid_p01_state">CANCELLED</set></cancelled>
          </search>
          <option name="count">10</option>
          <option name="drilldown">none</option>
        </table>
      </panel>
      <panel id="p02">
        <title>02. 로그 레벨별 추이</title>
        <chart>
          <search>
            <query>index=_internal sourcetype=splunkd | timechart count by log_level</query>
            <earliest>$tr.earliest$</earliest>
            <latest>$tr.latest$</latest>
            <progress><set token="sid_p02">$job.sid$</set></progress>
            <done><set token="sid_p02_state">$job.dispatchState$ ($job.runDuration$s)</set></done>
            <error><set token="sid_p02_state">ERROR: $message$</set></error>
            <cancelled><set token="sid_p02_state">CANCELLED</set></cancelled>
          </search>
          <option name="charting.chart">line</option>
          <option name="charting.legend.placement">bottom</option>
        </chart>
      </panel>
      <panel id="p03">
        <title>03. 호스트별 이벤트 수</title>
        <table>
          <search>
            <query>index=_internal | stats count by host | eventstats sum(count) as total | eval pct=round(count*100/total,2) | sort - count</query>
            <earliest>$tr.earliest$</earliest>
            <latest>$tr.latest$</latest>
            <progress><set token="sid_p03">$job.sid$</set></progress>
            <done><set token="sid_p03_state">$job.dispatchState$ ($job.runDuration$s)</set></done>
            <error><set token="sid_p03_state">ERROR: $message$</set></error>
            <cancelled><set token="sid_p03_state">CANCELLED</set></cancelled>
          </search>
          <option name="count">10</option>
          <option name="drilldown">none</option>
        </table>
      </panel>
  </row>
  <row>
      <panel id="p04">
